            "sid": "2SA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ndaviti athi na oosa mavĩndĩ ma Saulo na mavĩndĩ ma Yonathani mwana wake kuma kwa andũ ma Yavesi‐ngileati ala mamoyĩe nzĩanĩ nene ya Mbethi‐sani, vala Avilisiti maisũisye mũthenya ũla Avilisiti mamũaĩe Saulo ku Ngilivoa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
